OL,3,GNEWSANew speed limit on key route amid
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeed limits on a key commuter route
OL,7,Fhave been reduced in a bid to boost
OL,8,Fsafety.
OL,10,FA new 30mph limit is in place on the
OL,11,FA38, the main route into Taunton,
OL,12,Freplacing the previous 40mph zone.
OL,14,FThe speed restrictions have been
OL,15,Finstalled between the Orchard Grove
OL,16,Froundabout, the Silk Mills roundabout
OL,17,Fand Wellington Road.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
