OL,3,GNEWSANew speed limit on key route amid
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaunton Town Council said the change
OL,7,Ffollowed "concerns raised by local
OL,8,Fresidents about road safety,
OL,9,Fparticularly the risks for children
OL,10,Fcrossing the A38".
